      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在众多名人参加的派对讲台上，\n第一红宝石堂堂正正地，\n完美演奏了主办人点的曲子。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5ffceea82f5757a37f004763dcf6ef151018b450ebf644752edfcaf18470bfb4",
